<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_II__cl_18__para_b__subpara_iii> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for paragraph (e) the following paragraph: “(e) where a takaful operator carries on re-takaful business which includes family re-takaful business and general takaful business (excluding those businesses), the income of the fund established in respect of each of the businesses (in this section referred to as “re-takaful fund”, “family re-takaful fund” and “general fund” respectively) shall be treated as a separate source of income from the income of the shareholders’ fund in respect of those businesses.”;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
