<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_II__cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Income Tax Act 1967, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in subsection 2(1)—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
