<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_II__cl_4__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for the definition of “Labuan company” the following definition: ‘ “Labuan company” means a Labuan entity as provided under subsection 2b(1) of the Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990;’; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
