<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_II__cl_4__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "b" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
