<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_IV__cl_67__list_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection (2) the following subsection: “(2) This section applies to any instrument with respect to which it is shown to the satisfaction of the Collector— (a) that the effect is to transfer a beneficial interest in property from one company with limited liability to another such company, and that the companies are associated where one is the beneficial owner of not less than ninety per cent of the issued share capital of the other, or that a third company with limited liability is the beneficial owner of not less than ninety per centum of the issued share capital of each of the aforesaid companies; (b) that the transfer of the property of the associated companies is to achieve greater efficiency in operation; and (c) that the company referred to as the transferee company under this section is incorporated in Malaysia.”;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
