<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_VIII__cl_96> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 82(6) of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “(6)” the words “(5)”. New section 88a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_VIII__cl_97> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_VIII> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
