<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_VII__cl_84> <https://schema.org/text> "The Service Tax Act 2018, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in section 2, by inserting after the definition of “taxable service” the following definition: ‘ “imported taxable service” means any taxable service acquired by any person in Malaysia from any person who is outside Malaysia;’. Amendment of section 7"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
