<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_72> <https://schema.org/text> "The Labuan Business Activity Tax Act 1990, which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Chapter, is amended in subsection 2(1)—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
