<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_73> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 2A of the principal Act is amended by deleting subsection (2). Amendment of section 2b"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
