<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_74> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "74" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
