<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_76> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by deleting section 7. Substitution of section 8"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_77> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_VI> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
