<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_77> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 8 the following section: “Absence of basis period 8. Where a Labuan entity carrying on a Labuan business activity which is a Labuan trading activity does not have a basis period for a year of assessment, the Director General may direct that the basis period for that year of assessment and subsequent years of assessment to include a period or periods (which may be of any period) as specified in the direction.”. Amendment of section 8a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_VI__cl_78> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@/~chp_VI> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/24/eng@> .
